# java.net.URL/URI constructor → WHATWG parse (web:url); the __j_url_*
# prelude getters read the parsed object's fields.
#
# NOT movable to `platforms/jvm` as-is: `tree_register.rs` registers a platform
# SHORTHAND builtin only when its target is java-owned (`common:java.<op>`).
